{"version":1,"content":"<p>巴巴多斯天后Rihanna出名是各大品牌的搶手貨，她經常為品牌拍攝廣告。</p><p>最近Rihanna就與1歲女兒Rocki Irish一同為一法國時尚服飾品牌拍攝新一輯廣告。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Rihanna與女兒同穿上黑色皮</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T07:23:53.254743+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T07:01:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T07:17:14.993277+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T07:17:14.993277+00:00","content_hash":"1018258f81cc6b19b934df3b940c091626f1167bc9c29ecdf1ad4b7c28d8ac4d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}